2026-11-18 - Free/local CPU hypothesis tested
Action: Owner chose free/local AMD. Inspected public Mark ONNX/PCA metadata and
SDK window/conditioning/layout code; implemented an isolated pinned CPU probe.
Effect: Real CPU-only network inference and finite skin reconstruction succeed.
Why/mechanism: SDK CUDA dependence did not prove the released ONNX graph required
CUDA. Exact implicit condition, audio context/strength and PCA deltas are explicit.
Evidence: .local/cpu-probe.json records 30 synthetic frames, [30,301] outputs,
[61520,3] reconstruction, median20.26ms network frame and6.56ms one reconstruction.
Nine focused checks and pip consistency passed. Chapter05 is canonical evidence.
Next consequence: Implement/qualify postprocess, matching topology/rig and an
audio-clocked face player using actual speech. Do not switch to a coarse fallback.
Limits: Non-speech smoke input; no speech accuracy, SDK parity, rendering, real
end-to-end latency or peak-memory claim. Model assets/env stay ignored/local.

2026-11-18 - Speech-to-face research synthesis
Action: Traced pinned primary implementations and reviewed papers/model cards,
commercial CPU documentation, timing contracts and licenses before app work.
Effect: Chapter 04 and the source register provide a conditional shortlist,
bounded first slice and independent articulation/geometry/clock quality gates.
Why/mechanism: Camera tracking observes a performance; Verona must generate one.
Reviewed A2F paths use CUDA/TensorRT, while this machine lists AMD graphics.
Stock UniTalker also uses CUDA; CPU adaptation is a proposal, not a tested path.
Evidence: Twelve pinned repository receipts; code-level inference/alignment/
duration/playback traces; official commercial/model documentation; local hardware
inventory. Published benchmarks are not local measurements or universal rankings.
Tracking: vr-03/issue3 updated to In Progress; vr-05/issue4 and its unique saved
Project item verified. Fresh read recovered initial membership propagation lag.
Six book inputs and local document links/required TODO fields checked.
Next consequence: Resolve compute/service/license route and qualify real clips.
Limits: No model execution/install, voice upload, capture, app, commit or push.

